    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67218" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετοχέτ-ευσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>conveyance in a duct</i> or <i>channel</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐς τὸ ἔντερον τῶν ὑγρῶν μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SA</u>
					2.5
				</span></i>
			; 'derivation' (opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντίσπασις</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				1.382
			</span></i>, Id. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				8.18
			</span></i> tit. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Astrol.,
				<i>transference of nature</i> when a planet passes from
			conjunction with another into conjunction with a third, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>in Ptol.</u>
				188
			</span></i>.</div>
